    - id: elemental-sprite
      name: Elemental Sprite
      description: The rarest sprite variant has never merged with the land. Its near-formless light persists only where exceptional Coherence holds at sacred sites or converging leylines. Finding one reveals what the familiar water, forest and other sprite ecotypes once were.
